„Well, ladies, our darling Don Jose is off with his mother-in-law, and a trip to the Isla de Maravillas‟. They all laughed.
„That‟s where he makes his rounds among the fairer sex. We must carry on like we usually do and we must remain alert. The other day one of my daughters came and so did her swaggerer. Those two got into a tussle in the foyer. They were swearing and making moans, and then her lover left so no fun for her. I hope there aren‟t too many troubles from some miscreants. I would rather not be upset.‟ Then she said,
